---
---

<section class="about-box">
    <div class="about-icon" aria-hidden="true">
        <img src="/icons/code.svg" alt="" />
    </div>
    <div class="about-body">
        <h2 class="about-title" data-i18n="about.title">O meni</h2>
        <p class="about-text" data-i18n="about.text">{"Prvostupnik inženjer računarstva (bacc. ing. comp.)\nPrvostupnik računarstva usmjeren na backend razvoj. Iskustvo s Javom (Spring Boot), C#/.NET-om i Pythonom (FastAPI, SQLAlchemy, pandas). Tijekom prakse u MicroCacheu radio sam na backend i frontend funkcionalnostima sa Spring Bootom, Reactom i PostgreSQL-om, kontejnerizirao aplikacije Dockerom i radio u agilnom timu (Scrum, Kanban). Izrađujem i osobne backend projekte u Pythonu s automatiziranim testovima i CI-jem."}</p>
    </div>
</section>

<style>
    .about-box {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 1.5rem;
        margin-top: 2.25rem;
        padding: 1.5rem 1.75rem;
        background: #ffffff;
        border: 1px solid var(--color-divider);
        border-radius: 16px;
        break-inside: avoid;
    }

    .about-icon {
        flex-shrink: 0;
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        width: 56px;
        height: 56px;
        border-radius: 12px;
        background: var(--color-primary);
    }

    .about-icon img {
        width: 28px;
        height: 28px;
        filter: brightness(0) invert(1);
    }

    .about-body {
        border-left: 2px solid var(--color-line);
        padding-left: 1.5rem;
    }

    .about-title {
        font-size: 0.78rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: var(--color-primary);
        margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
    }

    .about-text {
        font-size: 0.98rem;
        line-height: 1.65;
        color: var(--color-text);
        white-space: pre-line;
        text-align: justify;
    }

    @media screen and (max-width: 600px) {
        .about-box {
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: flex-start;
            gap: 1rem;
            padding: 1.25rem;
        }

        .about-icon {
            width: 46px;
            height: 46px;
        }

        .about-body {
            border-left: none;
            padding-left: 0;
        }
    }
</style>
